<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66f14f762d9ed93be7e45532f52e341584cfa69a96a4b48ae6ab5277a1a358e7_n0086/tu_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "It should be reserved to highly selected cases after all non-invasive studies have been assessed. Fibrofatty replacement with or without replacement type fibrosis at RV septal biopsies are the characteristic findings. EMB has low sensitivity for the diagnosis of AC in cases of focal distribution." .
